    "text": "By Miles Vance ,\n1 days ago The train that is the Canby boys wrestling team rolls on, and the Cougars believe the best may yet be to come. The Cougars have rolled through the 2026 Northwest Oregon Conference season without a loss through the end of January, and believe that their beefed-up non-league schedule may pay big dividends before year’s end. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
